FortreeCity_House3_Text_MetStevenHadAmazingPokemon:
	.string "While speaking about DATAPADS,\n"
	.string "I remembered something.\p"
	.string "I met this TRAINER, LEIA, when\n"
	.string "I was searching for rare crystals.\p"
	.string "Hoo, boy, she had some amazing\n"
	.string "COMPANIONS with her.\p"
	.string "They weren't just rare, they were\n"
	.string "trained to terrifying extremes!\p"
	.string "She might even be stronger than the\n"
	.string "ARENA LEADER in this village…$"

FortreeCity_House3_Text_OhYouHavePokedex:
	.string "What's that thing you have there?\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "Oh, it's called a DATAPAD?\n"
	.string "It's really awesome!$"

